{"product_id":"skinny-bitch","title":"Skinny Bitch","description":"\u003cp\u003eNot your typical boring diet book, this is a tart-tongued, no-holds-barred wakeup call to all women who want to be thin. With such blunt advice as, \"Soda is liquid Satan\" and \"You are a total moron if you think the Atkins Diet will make you thin,\" it's a rallying cry for all savvy women to start eating healthy and looking radiant. Unlike standard diet books, it actually makes the reader laugh out loud with its truthful, smart-mouthed revelations. Behind all the attitude, however, there's solid guidance. Skinny Bitch espouses a healthful lifestyle that promotes whole grains, fruits, and vegetables, and encourages women to get excited about feeling \"clean and pure and energized.\"\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Rory Freedman | Kim Barnouin\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780762424931\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat:  Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 183\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750285189273,"sku":"1RA9780762424931","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/skinny-bitch-379464.jpg?v=1694791392","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/skinny-bitch","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}